 ▾ LOCAL │ IN THE HISTORY                                                       │OR  WHEN
 ● main  │ c         check it out                                               │ace   1h
   feat/g│ b         open a branch here                                         │
   fix/bo│ A         open a worktree                                            │ace   3h
   spike │ t         tag it                                                     │
 ▾ REMOTE│ T         tag it with a message                                      │per   1d
   orig… │ y         cherry pick it                                             │
   origin│ v         revert it                                                  │ace   2d
   origin│ m         move the branch here, keeping the changes                  │
 ▾ WORKTR│ M         move the branch here                                       │per  16d
   main  │ H         move the branch here, writing the tree over                │
   task… │ e         reword it                                                  │
   spike │ d         drop it from the history                                   │
   gone  │ S         fold it into the one before                                │
 ▾ STASHE│ f         fold it into the one before, keeping that message          │
   stash@│ [         move it up                                                 │
   stash@│ ]         move it down                                               │
 ▾ TAGS  │ p         write a patch                                              │
